Package: medinria
Architecture: any
Depends:
 libdtk-qt6-1.7 (>= 1.7.1-2~),
 ${shlibs:Depends},
 ${misc:Depends},
Description: medical image navigation and research tool
 medInria is a free medical image viewer and processing tool developed at
 Inria. It provides visualization of 3D/4D medical images, diffusion MRI
 processing (tensor estimation, tractography), image registration, and
 segmentation tools through a plugin-based architecture.
 .
 This package ships the medInria application, its private libraries and the
 full set of image-processing plugins.

Package: medinria-dev
Architecture: any
Section: libdevel
Depends:
 medinria (= ${binary:Version}),
 ${misc:Depends},
Description: medical image navigation and research tool - development files
 medInria is a free medical image viewer and processing tool developed at
 Inria (see the medinria package).
 .
 This package provides the headers and CMake configuration files needed to
 build software against medInria's libraries.
